'''Madame Eleanor Q. Goldsworth II''' is an [[NPC]] in the {{Zone|Walk of Fame}} in the [[Rift Dimension]]. They allow the player to enter the {{Zone|Wizardman Bureau}} after obtaining the {{Item|Celestial Timecharm}}.

== Purpose ==
'''Madame Eleanor Q. Goldsworth II''' prevents the player from entering the {{Zone|Wizardman Bureau}} until they have obtained the {{Item|Celestial Timecharm}}.

